    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweedeeda foojeanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina Haruni sea orjoagaaschi, sea buuneesean bea Israeli, Nih ng'asheanda rugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iideepa gwanuusa heeda siida wassean bea eemeeda Israeli ghana dayeenda gisilleanda ghana ea mbooyda gil aba jeeda maheemajeanda, ghana gwanuuksa murdeeda maheemajeanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea meesiikana gidaghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak ghoadayda ghoah haleanjeeda guskuseega bea NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa bea NG'UTAMIIDA, siidida gajeanung' ghoah gil mideawa riing'eeda aba giihiideayda foojeanda; niihiida foojeanda; ak abeeda siidida gajeasach aba jeeda buuneadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gweadu fuga Israeli lukghumajeega nyaawa nuukusa jarooda, ak gweadu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, heeda ashoohoocheanda mida gidaghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak gwanuuseada ghoah lukghumajeega was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwasaksa ashoohoocheanda foojeanda heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA mida ghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak ghaghwarda ghashneeda ghoah shearooda ng'andit aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea maygudu gabiikta gwanuus haleanjeeda nyaawa was lukghumajeega meangeenda, nea gwahiseada. Nih gayghoah deaweeda aba heanyaawa damanda manda muudeanooda aba seaygoojiga nyaawa sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gajeeshiina saawa, Siida wassean bea eemeeda Israeli, ghana ea rabasta mida bugusta nyaawa, adayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda ghana ea lukghumeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea meana ghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA lukghumeeda; siisi gajeasach aba jeeda buuneadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amadeepa siida wassean bea eemeeda Israeli ghana gaba rabasta mida jeenyaawa iiyak foojeanda wassean, gaydasach ghaat aba badaydeaba siisi ak foojeandean, ak gayghwasach siisi aba jeeda buuneadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba eaweega saseeda gwanda jeeda foojeanda; ak geagoonyeegwa aba heeda wagiida ak geasinyi giiduupcheeda aba badahuuka gurooruunatkeagwa; aba gideaba foojeanda dea sina giiduupcheeda, aba badayda eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeyeesha fuga Israeli, Manda siida jea ghwaak foojeanda aba jeedeang'wa, ghana rabascheanda mida jeedeang'wa jea ghwaak foojeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean aba jeeda fuga Israeli, ghana ea rabascheanda mida jeenyaawa, ak ghoang'waay diyeayda ghana ea dariideanda siyeaga gayghoahiida foojeandaanyi ak gang'alsa sigeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba eaweega gida wasean gwanda jeeda foojeanda, ak geayeeshi fuga Israeli, Majayaaga foojeanda diyeayda wassean, aba gideaba eaweega gili wasean gwanda jeeda foojeandaanyi; siida wassean jea ghwaak gajeasach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida wassean ak gidameah nea gaba geaw ghana ea dea ak diyeanga, ada ea siideaba ng'eang'i gil ghana ea rabascheanda, gaygoohuun hang'weakaaschi, ak gaygoohuun saseadaanyi aba beega, ak gaygaba ririnnyaan ea ghwahita shing'ada; ak abeeda gayghamiidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda iimeehuuna ghana goohuun saseadaanyi, gayghwanyas ng'asheega munyas.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
